{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 in a high-performing multimodal setup (multiprofile, avgpool aggregation, concat fusion), achieving validation accuracy of 0.6315 (F1: 0.6068), an improvement over the prior multimodal baseline (0.6186). The result suggests the RNA encoder may influence performance, but the exact contribution of this change versus other design factors remains uncertain without direct comparison to other encoders in the same configuration."
}

